      "writtenOn": "2023-09-12T17:11:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `add-additional-overrides\u003dyes` format option only adds essential overrides to the signature files (i.e. \"some\" concrete overriding methods -- more context is available [here](https://b.corp.google.com/issues/298052340)). However, some classes require more information than these not for compilation purpose, but for build time checks (hiddenapi, annotation processor) purposes. These classes are the ones. More context regarding this is available [here](https://b.corp.google.com/issues/298063727).",
