      "side": 1,
      "message": "How would we determine when a new class needs to be added here? Or are we confident somehow that there won\u0027t be any new ones? What kind of error message would someone whose change requires adding a class to this list experience? I was hoping the changes to the txt files would avoid this type of singling out specific classes because of the potential maintenance burden this implies",
